  <div class="hd-tag">CEE 340 &middot; Advanced Foundation Engineering &middot; Ch. 3</div>
  <h1>Design of Shallow Foundations</h1>
  <p class="hd-sub">A footing has to satisfy two separate criteria, and passing one tells you nothing about the other: the ground must not rupture beneath it, and it must not settle more than the structure can tolerate. This chapter is the first criterion.</p>
